OL,3,GNEWSAPrevent RNLI doxxing, social media
OL,4,Asites told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media platforms have been told
OL,7,Fthey must do more to protect people
OL,8,Ffrom doxxing and online abuse after
OL,9,Fpersonal details of RNLI volunteers
OL,10,Fwere shared online.
OL,12,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy chaired a
OL,13,Fmeeting to challenge firms, including
OL,14,FMeta, TikTok, Snap and YouTube owner
OL,15,FGoogle, after lifeboat crews were
OL,16,Ftargeted during anti-migrant protests.
OL,18,FNandy also wants tech companies to
OL,19,Ftackle videos that glorify dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving, saying she wants the UK to
OL,21,Fhave the "gold standard" of online
OL,22,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
